    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wele Paapa wefwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako sikila khuli ne baloli bakali bari, khe khulekhe buli siindu sikhukhiingililanga, ne bubwoni bubwakhutiila tatatatata, mala khutime chimbilo chili ebweeni wefwe ne liliekhaliilikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lekha khure chimoni chefwe khu Yesu, orakikhanga ne khutabusia lisuubila liefwe. Kumusalaba se kwakila aafwa kumwoyo tawe! Ne kakhali, sikila ekhoyo niyo aaba ne alikho acha khunyoola, se abonakho sisiindu simuambia chisoni mu khufwila khu musalaba tawe, ne luno ekhaale alubeka luseecha lwe ndebe eye bubwami eya Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yibaasia khu niko abiriramo, nga efwiilisia mu khubiilwa ne babooni! Khwako mukhafukiilila khufwa kimiooyo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila mukhukhaka khwenywe khuloba bubwoni, se mwapaane ne bubwoni khukhwola khukhwiirwa tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.5.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ayu. 5.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.3.11+PRO.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chis. 3.11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwebiliile kamakhuwa ke khumutinyilisia enywe niko Wele aamuboolela nga babaana bewe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kamekisio ne likaambila",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
