            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.19.16+EXO.19.17+EXO.19.18+EXO.19.19+EXO.19.20+EXO.19.21+EXO.19.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 19.16-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.18+EXO.20.19+EXO.20.20+EXO.20.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20.18-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.11+DEU.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 4.11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.22+DEU.5.23+DEU.5.24+DEU.5.25+DEU.5.26+DEU.5.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5.22-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Enywe se mwechile khu sikulu sia Sinai siili ne kumulilo, sisiilima, khukhwinamila, embembeesi, khukhupa khwe khoombi ne khuuliilikha khwe kumumilo nisio munyala mwatiilakho nga babaandu ba Isiraeli tawe. Nga babaandu baulila kumumilo, bekoonjelela bali bakhaulilakho likhuwa liliindi tawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.18+HEB.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.18",
              "HEB.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.19.12+EXO.19.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 19.12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " sikila abeele se banyala benyala mwilaka lilialoma lili, “Akhaba esaang'i ne yetiila khu sikulu, khukhwola yipwe kamabaale efwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.9.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 9.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kakabonekha kaba kariisia lukali nio Musa aloma ali, “Nariire ne khuterema!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali, mwechile khu Sikulu sia Sayuni lundi mu lukoba lwa Wele omenyile mindali, Yerusalemu lwe mwikulu, ne ba Malaika balwo chielefu bali ne khoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwechile mu libuusiana lie babaana babele ba Wele, nibo kamasina kabwe kaandikwa mwikulu. Mwechile khu Wele, oli omukhalaki owe babaandu boosi; ne khu roho che babaandu balayi babakholwa khuba babechufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lir. 4.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwechile khu Yesu ooli owe akari we babaandu ne Wele mu ndakaano embia, lundi mwechile khu mafuki kakachichukha kasuubisia bibiindu bilayi lukali khukhila kamafuki ka Apili ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
