                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nono, lola bulayi mukhakhola murio mwaloba khuulila oyo olomaloma tawe. Abo babaloba khuulila oyo owalomanga burume bwa Wele khu sibala se beebacha tawe. Nono, efwe khukhebache khuriena, kaaba bali se khuulila oyo olomalomanga khukhwama mwikulu tawe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.25",
